.toBe(false)\n        fireEvent.mouseEnter(item)\n        fireEvent.click(item)\n\n        expect(onHighlight).toHaveBeenCalledExactlyOnceWith(2)\n        expect(onSelect).toHaveBeenCalledExactlyOnceWith(option)\n    })\n})\n\r\n",
design\activity\card__5cdae748-9597-4d29-8dc0-3d4b5df3aa7f.json:4102:          "content": "Assuming “ampersand” means `@`. Literal `&` does not trigger this plugin.\n\nRoot cause: unbounded dataset plus unbounded rendering.\n\n- Local file indexing recursively includes everything except `.git`: [project_files.js](C:\\Users\\janbo\\Documents\\dev\\md2\\desktop\\src\\project\\project_files.js:76).\n- Current checkout produces about 127,035 paths, including 97,600 `app/node_modules` files and 23,010 `desktop/node_modules` files. Only 1,454 files are Git-tracked.\n- Plugin initializes query as empty. Empty query matches every path, creating 127k `MarkdownFileSearchOption` objects: [markdown_file_search_typeahead_plugin.tsx](C:\\Users\\janbo\\Documents\\dev\\md2\\app\\src\\components\\editor\\markdown_file_search_typeahead_plugin.tsx:21).\n- Typing `@` renders every matching option as a MUI component: [markdown_file_search_typeahead_plugin.tsx](C:\\Users\\janbo\\Documents\\dev\\md2\\app\\src\\components\\editor\\markdown_file_search_typeahead_plugin.tsx:61).\n- `maxHeight: 320` only clips display. It does not virtualize or limit DOM nodes.\n- Each query also scans repository list twice: trigger `.some(...)`, then option `.filter(...)`.\n- Closing/no match resets query to `''`, again representing “all files” instead of inactive search.\n\nTests missed this because integration test mocks whole plugin and uses at most two paths: [markdown_editor_file_search.test.tsx](C:\\Users\\janbo\\Documents\\dev\\md2\\app\\src\\components\\editor\\markdown_editor_file_search.test.tsx:46).\n\nRequired correction shape:\n\n1. Local repository index must honor Git ignore rules; exclude `node_modules`, build output, caches.\n2. Distinguish inactive query (`null`) from active empty query (`''`).\n3. Cap or virtualize displayed results.\n4. Avoid duplicate full-list scans.\n5. Add real large-index regression test; stop mocking plugin in critical integration coverage.\n\nNo changes made.\n\n",
